; A 1×1 AreaLight3D panel and a 4×0.05 strip at the same energy, over matte plates, for the one
; variable no other golden moves: area_normalize_energy dividing each light's colour by its area.
; unit-area-light3d draws one light, so it cannot show two sizes emitting the same total. A hidden
; DirectionalLight3D turns the editor preview sun off, so only the area lights reach the plates,
; and energy 1.0 keeps every plate below white.
